{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026V0OWEMQHWu1794468965.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>商人潘焯鴻被控兩項普通襲擊罪，他早上在九龍城裁判法院認罪，罰款2,400元。</p><p></p><p>潘焯鴻被控去年7月，在九龍城廣場一間店舖前襲擊一男一女，他們都是商場經理，被告原否認控罪。早上開審時，潘焯鴻改為認罪。</p><p></p><p>辯方求情時指，被告因兩名事主指示工人強行「爆門」，一時衝動，只是想保護自己財物，並非深思熟慮、有預謀的襲擊，就事件感非常悔疚，事件亦無人受嚴重傷害，希望罰款處理。裁判官曾宗堯最終就兩項控罪判罰款2,400元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.444375+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:31:48.119213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:15.845116+00:00","content_hash":"04063ef93579fd147d83fb9b747921327b9425ce9e58cc4f0b4b3998b063fb7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.444375+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}